# ============================================================
# AVS-OPS-001 (2026-09-04) — pre-commit-1 additions.
# Section 3 of the prompt permits one .gitignore edit before commit 3 to keep
# bulk out of the baseline commit. Verified NOT ignored at that point:
#   backups/        59 dirs, 14,518 files, 35.0 GB (5 files >100 MB)
#   data/canonical/ 6,261 stageable files, 463 MB of canonical dataset payloads
#   .codex_*/       vendored CPython runtimes, 5,849 files, 103.6 MB
#                   (ACK decision 2026-09-04: ignore rather than commit-then-attic,
#                    so the runtime never enters permanent history)
# data/ is NOT excluded wholesale: that would defeat the
# !data/universe/polygon_liquid_universe.csv negation above and untrack the
# 5 files already tracked under data/. The 9 files already tracked under
# backups/ are unaffected — .gitignore does not untrack.
# ============================================================
backups/
data/canonical/
.codex_*/
